  "post_content": "<p>El Centro de Empleo y Cultura de Onda acoge desde esta tarde noche la exposici&oacute;n &lsquo;Armon&iacute;as y contrastes&rsquo;, de la pintora soriana afincada en Castell&oacute;n Lola Tajahuerce, una muestra muy colorista que podr&aacute; visitarse hasta el pr&oacute;ximo 29 de febrero.<br />\n &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/02/IMG_8777.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Ha presentado a la artista la teniente de alcalde de Cultura, Mar&iacute;a Dolores Feliu, y al acto ha acudido una amplia representaci&oacute;n de la Corporaci&oacute;n Municipal, adem&aacute;s de compa&ntilde;eros y compa&ntilde;eras de la ense&ntilde;anza de Lola Tajahuerce, e incluso una ex-alumna que ahora estudia Bellas Artes. Tambi&eacute;n otras personas que forman parte de la Asociaci&oacute;n Movimiento Art&iacute;stico (AMART), a la que est&aacute; adscrita la pintora soriana, que trabaja como porfesora de dibujo en un instituto de l&#39;Alcora.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expololatajahuerce/img_8770.jpg\" alt=\"img_8770\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expololatajahuerce/img_8772.jpg\" alt=\"img_8772\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expololatajahuerce/img_8774.jpg\" alt=\"img_8774\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expololatajahuerce/img_8775.jpg\" alt=\"img_8775\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expololatajahuerce/img_8776.jpg\" alt=\"img_8776\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expololatajahuerce/img_8777.jpg\" alt=\"img_8777\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expololatajahuerce/img_8778.jpg\" alt=\"img_8778\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expololatajahuerce/img_8779.jpg\" alt=\"img_8779\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expololatajahuerce/img_8782.jpg\" alt=\"img_8782\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expololatajahuerce/img_8783.jpg\" alt=\"img_8783\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expololatajahuerce/img_8784.jpg\" alt=\"img_8784\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expololatajahuerce/img_8785.jpg\" alt=\"img_8785\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expololatajahuerce/img_8786.jpg\" alt=\"img_8786\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expololatajahuerce/img_8787.jpg\" alt=\"img_8787\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expololatajahuerce/img_8788.jpg\" alt=\"img_8788\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expololatajahuerce/img_8789.jpg\" alt=\"img_8789\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expololatajahuerce/img_8790.jpg\" alt=\"img_8790\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expololatajahuerce/img_8791.jpg\" alt=\"img_8791\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expololatajahuerce/img_8792.jpg\" alt=\"img